WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:02,420
Take her back now

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,980
I have already found a good teacher, no need

3
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:08,700
I will explain to grandpa and mom

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:11,460
Please accompany me to choose wedding clothes, these

5
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,140
It was supposed to be Wen Chen

6
00:00:13,730 --> 00:00:15,250
No matter family affection or interests

7
00:00:15,690 --> 00:00:17,690
Their first choice is always Su Linyun

8
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:21,420
Wenren was just an accident

9
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:25,500
It’s okay not to come back Tingfeng

10
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:28,580
Did you send your boss a request for inspection? Did your boss say that?

11
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,860
Private matters cannot be brought to work

12
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,020
Wedding and funeral prices are not acceptable.

13
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:35,270
To close the folder is to make mistakes.

14
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,380
Does your friend know

15
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:40,860
Otherwise, we won’t go to this engagement party.

16
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:42,420
No, you must go

17
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,580
Watch them go through the process with your own eyes and then tell me.

18
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:46,300
Don't let anything slip

19
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,020
Not to mention my friend's name

20
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,980
Xiao Zhuo won't like that real daughter, right?
